Translation Support Audit

Scope: lib/screens/**/*.dart
Files audited: 306
Method: read-only per-file analysis by 10 logical batches of 30 assignments; the runtime capped concurrency at 6, so each batch ran as five six-agent waves. Six overflow files were included because the folder contains 306 files.

Status legend: created = translation handling is present or the file is intentionally language-neutral; partial = mixed coverage; not-created = user-facing copy lacks translation handling; n/a = no translation responsibility.

